<section class="section" id="privacy-page" style="padding-top:3rem">
  <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
  <h1>Privacy Notice</h1>

  <h3>What's collected</h3>
  <p>What you submit through the contact form on this site — your name, email address, and message — plus anonymized visit statistics collected automatically for every visitor (see Analytics below).</p>

  <h3>Analytics</h3>
  <p>This site uses <a href="https://www.goatcounter.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GoatCounter</a>, a privacy-focused analytics tool, to see basic visit statistics — page views, referring sites, approximate country, and device/browser type. It doesn't use cookies, doesn't track you across other websites, and can't identify you personally.</p>
  <p>It also uses <a href="https://clarity.microsoft.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Microsoft Clarity</a> to understand how visitors use the page — anonymized heatmaps and session recordings of clicks, scrolling, and mouse movement. Clarity uses cookies and is not tied to your identity; see <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/clarity/faq" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Microsoft's Clarity FAQ</a> for details on how it handles data.</p>

  <h3>Why</h3>
  <p>Solely to read and reply to your message.</p>

  <h3>Third party</h3>
  <p>The contact form is delivered by <a href="https://formspree.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Formspree</a>, which receives what you submit in order to email it to me. See Formspree's own privacy policy for how they handle that data in transit.</p>

  <h3>Retention</h3>
  <p>Messages are kept only as long as needed to respond to you. They are not sold, shared, or used for any purpose beyond replying to your inquiry.</p>

  <h3>Contact</h3>
  <p>Questions about this notice or your data can be sent to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>

  <h3>This is separate from copyright</h3>
  <p>This notice covers data privacy only. Rules about reusing this site's content, design, or photography are in the footer copyright line on every page, not here.</p>

  <p><a href="/#top">← Back to the site</a></p>
</section>
